    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm looking at the draft for the Global Environment Fund grant. This $5M is basically make-or-break for OPI this year. In the 'Proven Impact' section, we need to show them we're a high-impact org that delivers real results. How should we describe the results from our last Pacific coral project to make sure we come across as a top-tier candidate for this funding?",
