      "content": "Do not inflate the data, as deceptive reporting is a serious risk in grant applications. Instead, pivot the narrative to emphasize the *process and the learning* derived from the 5% gain. You can frame the project as a successful pilot, detailing the high success rate of the *innovative methods used* even if the overall impact was small next to targets. This presents you as a rigorous, data-driven organization that is ready to adapt and improve for future, larger funding.",
